OL,3,GNEWSAM5 'gridlocks' spark shorter
OL,4,Aworking hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are calls for an urgent review
OL,7,Fafter repeated closures along a stretch
OL,8,Fof the M5 in Somerset have caused
OL,9,F"carnage" for businesses.
OL,11,FOne local haulage company said it has
OL,12,Fintroduced shorter working hours after
OL,13,Ffrequent disruption.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, an Indian restaurant manager
OL,16,Fsaid he felt like he suffered from jet
OL,17,Flag after being trapped in a six-hour
OL,18,Fdelay on the route, adding Fridays in
OL,19,Fsummer were "carnage without fail".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
