OL,3,GNEWSAM5 'gridlocks' spark shorter
OL,4,Aworking hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local MP debated the issue in
OL,7,FParliament urging ministers to review
OL,8,Fprocedures to avoid future "gridlocks".
OL,9,FNational Highways said it always
OL,10,Freopened the route as soon as possible,
OL,11,Fand Avon and Somerset Police added
OL,12,Fclosures were the safest way to gather
OL,13,Fevidence.
